{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"柏拉图·major-works","stage":"DONE","category":"plato","categoryLabel":"柏拉图","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.67,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/21_plato/4_major-works","introHtml":"<p>柏拉图（约公元前 427—前 347 年）几乎全部以<strong>对话体</strong>写作，存世 35 篇对话加 13 封书信，自 1578 年斯特凡努斯版以来统一用&quot;斯特凡努斯页码&quot;引用。本 hub 按学界通行的<strong>早—中—晚三期</strong>断代，逐部解剖这些著作<strong>作为文本本身</strong>——它们的成书年代、文本结构、核心论证、不朽意象与接受史。</p>\n<p><strong>本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</strong>：本 hub 关注&quot;著作&quot;这一对象；柏拉图的<strong>思想内容</strong>则分散于兄弟 hub，不在此重复展开——</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>：理念论、《理想国》作为政治蓝图、学园等&quot;贡献&quot;本身。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">理念与方法</a>：知识论、灵魂、辩证法等&quot;学说与方法&quot;。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>：身世、师从苏格拉底、叙拉古游历与建园。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a> 与 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>：后世影响与对其学说的批判。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话：在本 hub 你读&quot;柏拉图写了哪些书、各书讲什么、怎么读&quot;；在兄弟 hub 你读&quot;柏拉图主张什么、这些主张对不对&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径</strong>（前置：先读 <a href=\"../life-and-times/disciple-of-socrates/the-death-of-socrates\">生平·师从苏格拉底</a> 以理解对话体的由来）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    E[&quot;早期对话&lt;br/&gt;苏格拉底·诘问·困惑&quot;] --&gt; M[&quot;中期对话&lt;br/&gt;《理想国》+三杰作&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; L[&quot;晚期对话&lt;br/&gt;自我批判+宇宙/法律&quot;]&#10;    E -.最易入门.-&gt; M&#10;    M -.思想巅峰.-&gt; L\">graph LR\n    E[\"早期对话&lt;br/&gt;苏格拉底·诘问·困惑\"] --&gt; M[\"中期对话&lt;br/&gt;《理想国》+三杰作\"]\n    M --&gt; L[\"晚期对话&lt;br/&gt;自我批判+宇宙/法律\"]\n    E -.最易入门.-&gt; M\n    M -.思想巅峰.-&gt; L</pre><ol>\n<li><a href=\"early-dialogues/\">早期对话</a>——最接近历史上的苏格拉底，&quot;破而未立&quot;、以困惑收场，是入门起点。</li>\n<li><a href=\"middle-dialogues/\">中期对话</a>——<a href=\"middle-dialogues/the-republic-work\">《理想国》</a> 与《斐多》《会饮》《斐德罗》，思想与文采的双重巅峰，本 hub 的核心。</li>\n<li><a href=\"late-dialogues/\">晚期对话</a>——更抽象、更具自我批判性，《巴门尼德》甚至亲手诘难自己的理念论。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>读完三期，即可串起柏拉图思想&quot;从苏格拉底出发、建构体系、再自我反思&quot;的完整弧线。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"early-dialogues","title":"Early Dialogues","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/major-works/early-dialogues","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-socratic-dialogues","title":"苏格拉底对话","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/major-works/early-dialogues/the-socratic-dialogues"},{"seq":2,"slug":"aporetic-dialogues","title":"诘问式对话","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/major-works/early-dialogues/aporetic-dialogues"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"middle-dialogues","title":"Middle Dialogues","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/major-works/middle-dialogues","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-republic-work","title":"《理想国》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/major-works/middle-dialogues/the-republic-work"},{"seq":2,"slug":"phaedo-and-symposium","title":"《斐多》《会饮》《斐德罗》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/major-works/middle-dialogues/phaedo-and-symposium"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"late-dialogues","title":"Late Dialogues","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/major-works/late-dialogues","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"theaetetus-and-parmenides","title":"《泰阿泰德》与《巴门尼德》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/major-works/late-dialogues/theaetetus-and-parmenides"},{"seq":2,"slug":"timaeus-and-laws","title":"《蒂迈欧》与《法律》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/major-works/late-dialogues/timaeus-and-laws"}]}]}